{"id":"444942","name":"文蛤蛋花魔芋汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/444942/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"魔芋结","amount":"300克"},{"name":"文蛤","amount":"11个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1只"}],"sub":[{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：魔芋结。","img":"images/444942/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"文蛤（已清洗）。","img":"images/444942/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋（已打成蛋液）。","img":"images/444942/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"香葱。","img":"images/444942/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"猪油。","img":"images/444942/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将魔芋结撕开包装，待用。","img":"images/444942/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将文蛤下入清水锅中。","img":"images/444942/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"接着，合入魔芋结，搁点猪油、加点料酒。","img":"images/444942/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮开，至文蛤开口。","img":"images/444942/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后，加点盐、鸡精调味，倒入蛋液，搁入香葱。","img":"images/444942/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻匀，即成。","img":"images/444942/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}